{"title":"2017 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Supposed that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are nonzero real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e8aaaf637a1c7f04003b1010755d48c6dfa15bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x+y}{x-3y}=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"102\" height=\"41\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70fc3c7d38463c31fe0b506ffe2275c0cf59e372.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+3y}{3x-y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"53\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee656e5a312c047132ae4636767d630b1a290eef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -3\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearranging, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e8c3d002b6352d6d9a626dcf155e12099f89a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+y=-2x+6y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eab47dda8a725a40b0c1be9b21473fd909df796d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x=5y\\implies x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"155\" height=\"16\" />.\nSubstituting, we can convert the second equation into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/4/7747ecb70933102194eb756fe484589f11576ad2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+3x}{3x-x}=\\frac{4x}{2x}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"184\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>A more rigorous, step-by-step explanation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e8aaaf637a1c7f04003b1010755d48c6dfa15bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x+y}{x-3y}=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"102\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/1/301533c5902717a1216159e448a0929422dcc9c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+y=-2\\left(x-3y\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e8c3d002b6352d6d9a626dcf155e12099f89a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+y=-2x+6y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/648360d34ba49da6ce21605bac84b8228ca236e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x=5y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0110f1bb04c51b2a4d431bf14489fc1b48b37421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db9da993d1518b47ab5518f994d623f4f7d017ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+3y}{3x-y}=\\frac{1+3\\left(1\\right)}{3\\left(1\\right)-1}=\\frac{4}{2}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"223\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, we choose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/6/0767eab43354a52b47e69e32e893cbfe28f817dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we see that the given equation holds true, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d38cf6181bd309f5af68c961fe74d75a348e43b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3(1)+1}{1-3(1)} = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"114\" height=\"43\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/4/c141a51247a583b350430376f1b44faec4ed9dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+3y}{3x-y}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"135\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0459893b6e7c554d5a0d3ba8a3ce7ecb3cc0b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=ax$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"11\" />. The first equation converts into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/8/9685744e3f63732ff176c14d86d4a08f5648d776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(3+a)x}{(1-3a)x}=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"125\" height=\"43\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a10e5d9e8b39baaabe686f455dd3829fad1f739c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+a=-2(1-3a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />. After a bit of algebra we found out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0110f1bb04c51b2a4d431bf14489fc1b48b37421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> into the second equation it becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc019a1c78ddb73224399eac11ab13bd497d3b82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4x}{2x}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"103\" height=\"37\" /> - mathleticguyyy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1059\">https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1059</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/B0NUA9011OQ\">https://youtu.be/B0NUA9011OQ</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zTGuz6EoBWY?t=668\">https://youtu.be/zTGuz6EoBWY?t=668</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B\">2017 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b